#: data/maps/DewfordTown_House2/scripts.inc:29
msgctxt "DewfordTown_House2_Text_WantYouToHaveSilkScarf"
msgid ""
"Gorge your eyes on this!\p"
"It's a SILK SCARF. It's right at the\n"
"cutting edge of fashion, yeah!\p"
"Oh, I can see your eyes twinkling!\n"
"You appreciate my dazzling style!\p"
"Oh, you're a delight!\n"
"Here you go. I want you to have it!$"
msgstr ""
"好好欣赏一下这个吧！\p"
"这是丝绸围巾。\n"
"可是走在时尚最前沿的哦！\p"
"哦，我看到你的眼睛在发光了！\n"
"你懂得欣赏我耀眼的品味！\p"
"哦，你真是太可爱了！\n"
"来，这个送给你！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_House2/scripts.inc:38
msgctxt "DewfordTown_House2_Text_NoRoom"
msgid ""
"Oh, you don't have room?\p"
"Now, listen tight, this SCARF is a must-\n"
"have! Why, I would sell all my items\l"
"in order to get it!$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，你没有空位了？\p"
"听好了，这条围巾可是必备单品！\n"
"为了得到它，\l"
"我宁愿卖掉我所有的道具！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_House2/scripts.inc:44
msgctxt "DewfordTown_House2_Text_ExplainSilkScarf"
msgid ""
"The SILK SCARF raises the power of\n"
"NORMAL-type moves.\p"
"It's a marvelous SCARF that will go\n"
"with almost all POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""
"丝绸围巾能提高\n"
"一般属性招式的威力。\p"
"这是一条几乎和所有宝可梦\n"
"都很搭的神奇围巾！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown_House2/scripts.inc:50
msgctxt "DewfordTown_House2_Text_BrawlySoCool"
msgid ""
"Wow, you bothered to cross the sea\n"
"to visit DEWFORD?\p"
"Did you maybe come here because you\n"
"heard about BRAWLY?\p"
"He's so cool…\n"
"Everyone idolizes him.$"
msgstr ""
"哇，你特地漂洋过海\n"
"来武斗镇玩吗？\p"
"你该不会是听说了藤树的事\n"
"才来的吧？\p"
"他好酷啊……\n"
"大家都很崇拜他。$"
